* GENBCC 1 on the 2D axisymmetric seed (GEOTYP 1): BCs of object 1 cleared (negative BCCDEF kept), nodes with |r| < 0.05*min edge length get BCCDEF x = 1 (URZ 0), ECCTMP = 2 on edges not on the axis; the seed already holds exactly these BCs, so OUT.KEY equals the seed (oracle run)
KFREAD 0
SPIKE_SI.KEY
GENBCC 1
